    {
      "id": "YMXZT5etMvQCmD3VcVhD2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110.00030517578125,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 438.6087646484375,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 215293793,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1939971585,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791515539450,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "国内模型为主\n→ 阿里云 / 腾讯云内地：常驻网关（Higress 或自写）+ Redis\n别用函数计算 / 云函数，边缘函数只挡在前面",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CN1",
      "originalText": "国内模型为主\n→ 阿里云 / 腾讯云内地：常驻网关（Higress 或自写）+ Redis\n别用函数计算 / 云函数，边缘函数只挡在前面",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cCjbvpOIAEEhWLc4bAc9v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110.00779724121094,
      "y": 266,
      "width": 443.9687805175781,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 849120065,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1196424847,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791515539450,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "也要海外模型\n→ 内地入口 + 境外节点调海外模型\n出口放在 OpenAI / Anthropic 支持的地区（如新加坡、东京）\n阿里云境外节点记得手动升级 CDT",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CN2",
      "originalText": "也要海外模型\n→ 内地入口 + 境外节点调海外模型\n出口放在 OpenAI / Anthropic 支持的地区（如新加坡、东京）\n阿里云境外节点记得手动升级 CDT",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WoeGXwEeVEopdh4tjzPEu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70.00778198242188,
      "y": 422,
      "width": 32.00006103515625,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
